				<r3d:description language="eng">This instance of SciCat contains a reference to all the data collected at the European Spallation Source.

SciCat (Scientific Data Catalog) allows users to access the metadata of raw and derived data collected during experiment  at the adopting facilities. Scientific datasets are linked to proposals and samples. They also can be publicly accessible and linked to publications with a registered DOI. 
SciCat helps improving data provenance, manages data access permissions, and allows users to find the data their are looking for by leveraging the associated metadata. 
SciCat, and all the tools in its ecosystem, help to better manage a facility data and to automate scientific analysis workflows.

More information at https://scicatproject.org</r3d:description>
